GD: image creation and manipulation with libgd of the package az (PNG,
JPEG, WebP, FreeType).

The module gd of PHP 8.3 for php83 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20230831/gd.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d, its headers in
include/php83/php/ext/gd.
